invalid type: string "ICT in Transport\nClosed Circuit TV (CCTV):\nMonitor road traffic, accidents, and illegal activities\nTraffic Light Control System:\nAutomated lights positioned at road junctions\nMinimize accidents by controlling vehicle traffic and pedestrians\nParking Identification Placard:\nEntrance pass stuck on windshield\nSensors read placard and open gates for pre-registered vehicles